# Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) combined with ZnO quantum dots as a fluorescent sensing platform for phosphate

Di Zhao a, Xiangyu Wan a,  Hongjie Song a, Liying Hao a,  Yingying Su b,  Yi Lv a,∗
a Key Laboratory of Green Chemistry $\boldsymbol{\varepsilon}$ Technology, Ministry of Education, College of Chemistry, Sichuan University, Chengdu, Sichuan 610064, China b Analytical & Testing Center, Sichuan University, Chengdu, Sichuan 610064, China
## a r t i c l e i n f o
## a b s t r a c t
